import Toybox.Weather;
//! Weather line under the horizon: "−3°  FEELS −9  UV 1  1013↓2".
//! Only the weather cached by the watch is read; the face makes no network
//! requests. Parts are kept separately so each can carry its own status colour:
//!   FEELS   shown only when it differs from the air temperature by 2° or more
//!   UV      shown from 1; amber from 6, coral from 8 (WHO bands)
//!   PRESSURE sea-level hPa with the 3-hour tendency from the watch barometer;
//!           amber when it changes by 3.6 hPa or more in 3 hours (a front)
//! Conditions older than 3 hours are drawn grey.
